# Astra ui/views layer — Chromium Views UI additions.
#
# This layer owns Astra-specific Views surfaces that augment Chrome's BrowserView
# instead of replacing the desktop UI stack. Toolbar, tab strip, WebUI, DevTools,
# download UI, and profile plumbing all stay on Chromium rails.
#
# Surfaces:
#   - AstraBrowserView            (controller that installs Astra widgets into BrowserView)
#   - AstraSidebarView            (left sidebar root container)
#   - AstraSidebarSectionView     (sidebar section with header + items)
#   - AstraSidebarItemView        (individual sidebar row item)
#   - AstraWorkspaceSwitcherView  (workspace selector at top of sidebar)
#
# Rules:
#   - UI code must not be a product state truth source.
#   - State comes from astra/browser services or Chromium subsystems.
#   - All Astra-only commands forward to AstraCommandDelegate.

