# Interactive UI tests for views-layer integration with BrowserView.
#
# These tests exercise Astra views inside a real browser window using
# InteractiveViewsTestApi and InProcessBrowserTest.  They verify that
# Astra widgets are installed correctly, respond to commands, and
# integrate with Chromium's BrowserView lifecycle.
#
# TODO(astra): Implement interactive_ui_tests for AstraBrowserView,
# AstraSidebarView, AstraSplitViewController, and command palette.
# Patch point: //chrome/test:interactive_ui_tests test suite.
